{
    "schemaVersion": 1,

    "slug": "pcf-tag-list",
    "name": "Tag List",
    "tagline": "A multi-select lookup for model-driven forms: related records as chips, with a type-ahead to attach more.",
    "category": "data",
    "hosts": [
        "model-driven"
    ],
    "tags": [
        "react",
        "chips",
        "many-to-many",
        "multi-select",
        "lookup"
    ],

    "control": {
        "namespace": "PCFHub",
        "constructor": "TagList",
        "type": "dataset",
        "framework": "react_virtual",
        "manifestPath": "TagList/ControlManifest.Input.xml"
    },

    "links": {
        "homepage": "https://github.com/pcfhub/pcf-tag-list",
        "support": "https://github.com/pcfhub/pcf-tag-list/issues",
        "license": "MIT"
    },

    "docs": {
        "path": "docs"
    },

    "media": {
        "logo": "media/logo.png",
        "screenshots": [
            "media/chips.png",
            "media/search.png",
            "media/narrow.png"
        ]
    },

    "demo": {
        "fidelity": "mocked",
        "limitations": [
            "The tags come from the preset's Sample data, not from Dataverse. On a form the chips are the subgrid's view, search asks the tag table through the Web API, and linking and unlinking are $ref requests on the relationship; there is no environment behind the demo, so each preset carries a JSON tag table in the sampleData property and the control plays against that. Search, attach, create, unlink, +N more and the refusal line all run the control's own code against it.",
            "The relationship is declared in the sample. On a form the control reads it from the two tables' metadata, and says so when more than one relationship joins them, as the 'More than one relationship' preset shows.",
            "Browse is not offered: it opens the platform's own lookup dialog, which only a model-driven app has.",
            "Opening a tag reports it through the Selected tag output and navigates nowhere. On a form it opens the tag's record.",
            "Changes last until the preset changes or the page reloads; nothing is saved."
        ],
        "bundle": "out/controls/TagList/bundle.js",
        "styles": [
            "out/controls/TagList/css/TagList.css"
        ],
        "datasetFixture": "demo/tags.json",
        "presets": [
            {
                "slug": "default",
                "name": "Many-to-many",
                "isDefault": true,
                "description": "An account with six tags from a shared vocabulary of 24. Type to find more (try \"re\"), pick one to link it, or type a new name to create it. The × unlinks a tag; the tag itself stays and can be found again.",
                "props": {
                    "allowCreate": true,
                    "allowNewTags": true,
                    "maxVisible": 12,
                    "primaryNameField": "name",
                    "relationshipName": "",
                    "parentLookupField": "",
